# Dependencies
node_modules

# Claude Code's own directory: agent worktrees, session state, and the settings
# files, which is where its personal permission rules live — absolute paths with
# the user's name in them. Ignored as a whole and re-included per directory, so a
# file Claude Code adds next needs no new rule to stay out of `git add -A`: it
# would otherwise reach the public repo, which is exported from the tracked tree
# (T-0241). `.claude/agents/` is ours and tracked — CLAUDE.md sends the worker there.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/

# Local artifacts
# Agent session logs written by the server's session runner (T-0076)
.briefboard/
# tools/task.mjs writes doc/backlog.md.tmp during an atomic save
*.tmp
*.log
# withFileLock creates cross-process lock files (e.g. doc/backlog.md.lock)
*.lock

# OS clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# User task data - the tool tracks YOUR tasks; they are not part of the tool
doc/backlog.md
doc/backlog-archive.md
doc/brief/*
!doc/brief/.gitkeep
